{"video":"JIs7qNQcQAE","lines":[{"t":[0,3],"en":"-Dwight, care to join us, finally?"},{"t":[3,5.4],"en":"Thank you."},{"t":[5.4,7.5],"en":"-Hey, Dwight, pass the tardy sauce."},{"t":[7.5,8.7],"en":"Get it, Michael? -Yes."},{"t":[8.7,9.9],"en":"-Okay."},{"t":[9.9,12.5],"en":"Here is the dream team."},{"t":[12.5,14.5],"en":"My sales dream team."},{"t":[14.5,16.7],"en":"Today, we are going to team up for sales calls."},{"t":[16.7,20],"en":"Andy, since this was your idea, you get to pick first."},{"t":[20,24.6],"en":"-Hmm. Well, let me think about this for a minute."},{"t":[24.6,26.7],"en":"Oh, I don't know."},{"t":[26.7,31.6],"en":"Michael Scott, Ph.D., doctor of sales."},{"t":[31.6,33.8],"en":"-Well, I appreciate that. That's very gracious of you."},{"t":[33.8,36],"en":"-Well, it is very gracious of you to accept."},{"t":[36,38.5],"en":"-Well, thank you, sir."},{"t":[38.5,41.6],"en":"Okay. I'm now going by seniority."},{"t":[41.6,43.4],"en":"Phyllis, our resident senior."},{"t":[43.4,46.1],"en":"-We're the same age."},{"t":[46.1,49],"en":"And I'll pick Karen."},{"t":[49,50.8],"en":"-Oh, uh, thanks."},{"t":[50.8,52.3],"en":"-Good."},{"t":[52.3,55.6],"en":"Next up, the superfly himself, Stanley."},{"t":[55.6,56.5],"en":"-Pass."},{"t":[56.5,58.5],"en":"You can't pass. You got to pick somebody."},{"t":[62.5,64.1],"en":"-I'll take the kid."},{"t":[64.1,66.5],"en":"-I'm very flattered."},{"t":[66.5,69.5],"en":"I was his second choice after \"pass.\""},{"t":[69.5,72.4],"en":"So that just leaves Dwight and Jim."},{"t":[72.4,74.3],"en":"-Okay, wait. Does anyone want to trade?"},{"t":[74.3,75.9],"en":"-Yeah. Trade."},{"t":[75.9,79],"en":"Dwight and I used to go on sales calls all the time."},{"t":[79,82.1],"en":"In fact, I have a picture to remember that time."},{"t":[82.1,88],"en":"-Oh, young Jim, there's just so much I need to warn you about."},{"t":[88,92.7],"en":"And yet, tragically, I cannot."},{"t":[92.7,95.8],"en":"-Sebring by Chrysler."},{"t":[95.8,98.5],"en":"It's a heck of a motor carriage."},{"t":[98.5,99.3],"en":"-Dwight!"},{"t":[99.3,101.3],"en":"-Yeah. -Here you go!"},{"t":[101.3,102.6],"en":"-Yeah!"},{"t":[102.6,103.7],"en":"You want shirts on hangers?"},{"t":[103.7,104.7],"en":"-Please."},{"t":[104.7,106.4],"en":"-Who does your laundry?"},{"t":[106.4,108.2],"en":"-Long story."},{"t":[108.2,110.7],"en":"All right, everybody, circle up."},{"t":[110.7,112.2],"en":"Here we go."},{"t":[112.2,113.7],"en":"You know what this is."},{"t":[113.7,115.5],"en":"This is the Amazing Race."},{"t":[115.5,117.4],"en":"And you guys are the retired Marines."},{"t":[117.4,119.7],"en":"And you guys are the mother-daughter."},{"t":[119.7,122.2],"en":"And you guys are the gay couple."},{"t":[122.2,124.6],"en":"And we are the firefighter heroes."},{"t":[124.6,125.6],"en":"Are we ready to go?"},{"t":[125.6,129.1],"en":"-Wait. Are we Amazing Race, like, the biggest sale wins?"},{"t":[129.1,130.7],"en":"-No. We're just gonna rush out,"},{"t":[130.7,132],"en":"do the sales thing, and come back."},{"t":[132,132.8],"en":"-Is there a prize?"},{"t":[132.8,134],"en":"-Just bragging rights."},{"t":[134,135.6],"en":"-Then how is this Amazing Race?"},{"t":[135.6,137.8],"en":"-It's just..."},{"t":[137.8,140.2],"en":"It's Amazing Race, Phyllis. Okay?"},{"t":[140.2,142.7],"en":"We're in teams of two, and we are on a mission."},{"t":[142.7,143.7],"en":"All right."},{"t":[143.7,145.8],"en":"So, on your mark, get set, go!"},{"t":[145.8,147.6],"en":"Let's do it! -Come on!"},{"t":[152.6,154.2],"en":"-Michael. -Whoa, whoa."},{"t":[154.2,156.3],"en":"-Oh-ho-ho-ho!"},{"t":[156.3,158.8],"en":"-Vamanos! -Bueno."},{"t":[158.8,161.3],"en":"-Do you have a pole?"},{"t":[161.3,162.9],"en":"-Let's go get a broom."},{"t":[162.9,164],"en":"-Seriously?"},{"t":[164,165.4],"en":"You're gonna sit in the back?"},{"t":[165.4,166.6],"en":"-Uh, yeah."},{"t":[166.6,168.3],"en":"That's the safest part of a car."},{"t":[168.3,169.3],"en":"In the event of a crash,"},{"t":[169.3,172.4],"en":"the driver always protects his side first."},{"t":[172.4,172.8],"en":"-Aah!"},{"t":[183.8,185.8],"en":"-I'm not sure."}]}
